   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Bye Bye Blues**: back after 283 archived shows (1996 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n- **The Lonesome River**: rare: 11 archived performances [3]\n- **Reubin's Train**: back after 103 archived shows (752 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n- **My Love Come Rolling Down**: back after 70 archived shows (491 days) [3]\n- **Tentacal Dragon**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Salty Dog**: rare: 8 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2025-08-16** (recommended): audience recording; 27 songs; 155 min; rated 4/5 by 1 [1]. Said about its sound: Reviewer reports many jumps in volume throughout the audience recording, though the show itself is otherwise good [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Reviewer asks whether the Bozeman audience recording had the same volume jumps; they heard none there [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2025-08-16**: taped by G-Man; transferred by G-Man; source: Aud> Audio Technica AT-2020> Tascam DR-40X [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Adams Center 2025 - Regular Poster - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/adams-center-2025-regular-poster/) [4]\n- Poster by Wear It Loud Tee: [Official Billy Strings On Aug 16 2025 At Adams Center In Missoula MT Poster Shirt, hoodie, sweater, long sleeve and tank](https://wearitloudtee.com/product/official-billy-strings-on-aug-16-2025-at-adams-center-in-missoula-mt-poster-shirt/) [5]\n- Fan art by Wear It Loud Tee: [Official Billy Strings On Aug 16 2025 At Adams Center In Missoula MT Poster Shirt, hoodie, sweater, long sleeve and tank](https://wearitloudtee.com/product/official-billy-strings-on-aug-16-2025-at-adams-center-in-missoula-mt-poster-shirt/) [6]\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Adams Center 2025 - Regular Poster - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/adams-center-2025-regular-poster/) [7]\n- Poster by Wear It Loud Tee: [Official Billy Strings On Aug 16 2025 At Adams Center In Missoula MT Poster Shirt, hoodie, sweater, long sleeve and tank](https://wearitloudtee.com/product/official-billy-strings-on-aug-16-2025-at-adams-center-in-missoula-mt-poster-shirt/) [8]\n- Poster by @admin: [Official Billy Strings At Adams Center On August 16 2025 Poster shirt](https://milkywayshirt.com/product/official-billy-strings-at-adams-center-on-august-16-2025-poster-shirt/) [9]",
